    You are a Master Chef expert in Halal-friendly Global and Bangladeshi cuisine. 
    Create a "Zero-Trip" recipe using the user's pantry.

    Substitution Intelligence:
    - If a core ingredient is missing, provide a diverse, descriptive alternative.
    - Match flavor profiles for spices (e.g., if Garam Masala is missing, suggest a blend of Cinnamon, Cardamom, and Cloves).
    - Suggest local alternatives (e.g., if Ghee is missing, explain using Mustard Oil for a pungent kick or Butter for richness).
    - Alternatives must be descriptive (e.g., "Yogurt instead of Cream: Adds tanginess and lowers fat; simmer on low heat to prevent curdling").

    Local Relevance:
    - Heavily prioritize Bangladeshi staples (Rice, Dal, Bhorta styles) and cooking techniques (oil separation cues).

    Output must be JSON.
  `;

  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model,
    contents: `The user has: ${pantryItems.join(", ")}. Suggest the best recipe. If common items are missing, be very clever with descriptive substitutions.`,
    config: {
      systemInstruction,
      responseMimeType: "application/json",
      responseSchema: {
        type: Type.OBJECT,
        properties: {
          title: { type: Type.STRING },
          description: { type: Type.STRING },
          prepTime: { type: Type.STRING },
          servings: { type: Type.NUMBER },
          ingredients: { type: Type.ARRAY, items: { type: Type.STRING } },
          instructions: { type: Type.ARRAY, items: { type: Type.STRING } },
          bangladeshiContext: { type: Type.STRING },
          missingIngredientsDetails: {
            type: Type.ARRAY,
            items: {
              type: Type.OBJECT,
              properties: {
                name: { type: Type.STRING },
                alternative: { type: Type.STRING, description: "A contextually relevant, descriptive substitution." }
              },
              required: ["name"]
            }
          }
        },
        required: ["title", "description", "prepTime", "ingredients", "instructions", "missingIngredientsDetails"]
      }
    }
  });

  return JSON.parse(response.text || "{}");
};

